        "text_Ug383X": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>HEAVENLY ESSENTIALS intimates are designed to last longer (up to 3x) than synthetics, cotton or other materials, due to the long and strong fibers of the flax plant. If proper care is taken with washing, each piece can last for several years, making them a great investment.</p><p>The Compost Collective Membership program offers a circular solution to the growing crisis of clothing waste. We partnered with a local Los Angeles compost center to redirect clothing from going to the landfill, and compost it instead, to become nutrient-rich soil. Composting offers a sustainable solution that works with nature’s natural recycling process.</p><p>After years of love and wear - at the end of your garments life, send your pieces to the compost and earn rewards points that will be applied towards your next purchase. Compost Collective members earn credits towards future purchases when sending their garments to the compost at end-of-life! </p>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 4
          }
        },
