        },
        "text_7cEU4P": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Heavenly Essentials envisions a future where fashion is circular,  regenerative and restorative; turning clothes and textiles into valuable resources, that actually nourish the Earth, rather than creating waste.</p><p>The Compost Collective completely reimagines the fashion cycle- to move towards a new circular economy that restores our planet, one essential at a time.</p>",
